{"scene_description":"The image depicts the interior of a modern library or bookstore. The space is well-lit with natural light coming through large windows on the right side, and artificial lighting from ceiling fixtures. The focal point of the room is a tall cylindrical bookcase in the center, illuminated from within and containing multiple levels of books. Surrounding this central feature are several rows of wooden bookshelves filled with books, some of which have colored spines. The floor is made of polished wood, and there are round tables with orange chairs arranged around them for seating. People can be seen sitting at these tables, likely reading or studying. The overall atmosphere is bright, clean, and inviting, suggesting a place designed for learning and relaxation."}

